Where do we use an index??
    numbers[index] = value...
    To find or access a value.. we must use index.

* Remove() --> what value
We directly insert a certain value to remove 

* Insert () --> What to insert and where to insert?
So we need to give both the index(location) and the value.

* Append () --> What to append?
So we need value only.

* Extend() --> What to extend and Where to Extend?
In a simple list we just simply need to give value to extend.
If it is a nested list and we want to point out the list to be extended..-> We give the Location/Index.

* pop() --> Where to pop?
When we want to pop something ; we want to pop something which is occupying the index value.
